## Allowed Commands

| Command | When OK |
|---------|---------|
| Read, Glob, Grep | Always |
| Shell (npm install, build, lint) | Always |
| Write, StrReplace | In allowed folders only |
| Delete | Only if explicitly asked |

## Blocked Commands

| Command | Why Blocked |
|---------|-------------|
| git push | Must be approved |
| rm -rf | Destructive |
| npm publish | Deployment must be approved |

---

## Onboarding Flow for New AI Session

```
1. AI reads CLAUDE.md
2. AI reads VIBE_RULES.md §1-2 (golden rules)
3. AI reads relevant AGENTS.md §10 (role template)
4. AI is ready to assist
```

